  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>dt</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Again&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now adding equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><msubsup><menclose notation=\"right\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>ln</mi></mfrac><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></menclose><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
